    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπελ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for vines,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γῆ</span>
			<i>vine</i>-land, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				90.15
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rosetta</span>), cf.
				<i>Mélanges Holleaux</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γῆ,</span> a bituminous earth (cf.
				<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				35.194
			</span></i>) <i>used to cure</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθειρίασις</span>”
				<i>in vines,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidon.
					64
				</span></i>
			; as a cosmetic, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.160
			</span></i>.</div>
